  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BOMFA Cooperative Sunflower and Soy Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Sunflower and soy..Location: Kasungu..Summary: This project will enable BOMFA to increase production of sunflower and soy through improved inputs and agronomic practices, and earn more income through modern sunflower processing into cooking oil and sunflower cake. The project will also support BOMFA to develop its business by undergoing trainings, developing a business plan, and applying to pre-certification from the Malawi Bureau of Standards.</narrative>
  </description>
